{"seq":2,"slug":"snapshot-and-ui-testing","title":"快照测试与 UI 自动化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/ios-swiftui-advanced/testing/snapshot-and-ui-testing","wordCount":542,"readingTime":3,"html":"<h1 id=\"快照测试与-ui-自动化\">快照测试与 UI 自动化</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>SwiftUI 视图是状态的纯函数——给定相同输入，输出相同像素。这一特性使快照测试（Snapshot Testing）成为最自然的回归检测手段：对 View 在特定状态下渲染的位图做像素级存档，后续每次运行比对差异，任何非预期的视觉变化都会被捕获。配合 XCUITest 的行为自动化，可以构建从视觉正确性到交互流程的完整 UI 质量网。主流方案是 Point-Free 的 swift-snapshot-testing 库（支持 SwiftUI 原生渲染，无需模拟器运行）。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    subgraph 快照测试&#10;        S1[给定状态输入] --&gt; S2[渲染 View 为位图]&#10;        S2 --&gt; S3{与参考图比对}&#10;        S3 --&gt;|一致| Pass[PASS]&#10;        S3 --&gt;|差异| Diff[生成 Diff 图]&#10;        Diff --&gt; Review[人工审查]&#10;        Review --&gt;|预期变更| Update[更新参考图]&#10;        Review --&gt;|非预期| Fix[修复代码]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph UI 自动化&#10;        U1[XCUIApplication.launch] --&gt; U2[查找元素]&#10;        U2 --&gt; U3[执行交互]&#10;        U3 --&gt; U4[断言状态]&#10;    end\">flowchart TD\n    subgraph 快照测试\n        S1[给定状态输入] --&gt; S2[渲染 View 为位图]\n        S2 --&gt; S3{与参考图比对}\n        S3 --&gt;|一致| Pass[PASS]\n        S3 --&gt;|差异| Diff[生成 Diff 图]\n        Diff --&gt; Review[人工审查]\n        Review --&gt;|预期变更| Update[更新参考图]\n        Review --&gt;|非预期| Fix[修复代码]\n    end\n    subgraph UI 自动化\n        U1[XCUIApplication.launch] --&gt; U2[查找元素]\n        U2 --&gt; U3[执行交互]\n        U3 --&gt; U4[断言状态]\n    end</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>测试类型</th>\n<th>验证目标</th>\n<th>运行速度</th>\n<th>典型工具</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>快照测试</td>\n<td>像素级视觉正确性</td>\n<td>快（无需模拟器）</td>\n<td>swift-snapshot-testing</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>XCUITest</td>\n<td>用户交互流程</td>\n<td>慢（需要模拟器）</td>\n<td>XCTest UI Testing</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Accessibility 审计</td>\n<td>辅助功能合规</td>\n<td>快</td>\n<td><code>.accessibilityPerformAutoAudit()</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Preview 测试</td>\n<td>编译时 Preview 不崩溃</td>\n<td>中等</td>\n<td><code>swift build --target</code></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"swift-snapshot-testing-集成\">swift-snapshot-testing 集成</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"swift\" data-code=\"import XCTest&#10;import SnapshotTesting&#10;import SwiftUI&#10;&#10;final class TaskRowSnapshotTests: XCTestCase {&#10;&#10;    func testTaskRow_default() {&#10;        let view = TaskRow(task: .mock)&#10;            .frame(width: 375)&#10;            .padding()&#10;&#10;        assertSnapshot(of: view, as: .image(layout: .device(config: .iPhone13)))&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    func testTaskRow_darkMode() {&#10;        let view = TaskRow(task: .mock)&#10;            .frame(width: 375)&#10;            .padding()&#10;            .environment(\\.colorScheme, .dark)&#10;&#10;        assertSnapshot(of: view, as: .image(layout: .device(config: .iPhone13)))&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    func testTaskRow_completed() {&#10;        let view = TaskRow(task: .mockCompleted)&#10;            .frame(width: 375)&#10;            .padding()&#10;&#10;        assertSnapshot(of: view, as: .image(layout: .device(config: .iPhone13)))&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    func testTaskRow_largeText() {&#10;        let view = TaskRow(task: .mock)&#10;            .frame(width: 375)&#10;            .padding()&#10;            .dynamicTypeSize(.accessibility3)&#10;&#10;        assertSnapshot(of: view, as: .image(layout: .device(config: .iPhone13)))&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> XCTest</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> SnapshotTesting</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">im